forked from dwm (suckless.org).


INSTALL

  curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/d2tx/bytewm/master/setup-arch.sh | sh


KEYBINDINGS

  Super+Return          Toggle scratchpad (dropdown terminal)
  Super+Shift+Return    Open terminal (st)
  Super+p               App launcher (bytelaunch)
  Super+Shift+m         Favorites menu (bytemenu)
  Super+s               Screenshot (bytesnap)
  Super+c               Color picker (bytepick)
  Super+w               Kill window
  Super+Ctrl+l          Lock screen (bytelock)
  Super+F10/F11/F12     Volume down / up / mute

  Super+j/k             Focus next/prev
  Super+Shift+j/k       Swap windows
  Super+h/l             Shrink/grow master (tile)
  Super+Ctrl+h/g         Shrink/grow client (BSP)
  Super+z               Zoom (swap master)
  Super+Tab             Previous workspace
  Alt+Tab               Window switcher (all workspaces)
  Super+Shift+Space     Toggle floating
  Super+f               Toggle fullscreen

  Super+1..5            Switch workspace
  Super+Shift+1..5      Move window to workspace
  Super+0               Show all workspaces

  Super+t               Tile layout
  Super+b               BSP layout
  Super+m               Monocle layout
  Super+Space           Floating layout

  Super+Shift+r         Reload config (restart)
  Super+Shift+q         Quit menu

MOUSE

  Super+Left click      Move window
  Super+Right click     Resize window
  Super+Scroll         Cycle windows


CONFIG

  Visual settings via ~/.config/bytewm/config (no recompile):
    font, color.*, barheight, borderpx, gappx, gappoh, gappoi, showbar, topbar

  Keybindings, commands, and rules via config.h (recompile).


APPS

  bytefetch    System info (neofetch-like), pure asm
  bytelaunch   dmenu-style app launcher
  bytemenu     Favorite apps quick-launcher
  byteswitch   Window switcher (Alt+Tab)
  bytesnap     Screenshot utility
  bytepick     Color picker (click screen for hex)
  bytelock     Screen locker (PAM, x86_64 asm)
  bytewm-exit  Logout / restart / shutdown dialog
  bytify       Notification daemon
  bytevol      Volume OSD
  bytepass     Password generator (x86_64 asm)
  bytekill     Process killer (x86_64 asm)
  bytewdm      Display manager (login greeter)
